### 5. Insert Registration Without Image
POST http://localhost:5000/api/registration
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Rahul Patel",
    "email": "rahul@example.com",
    "password": "rahul123",
    "gender": "Male",
    "hobbies": "[\"Reading\",\"Sports\"]",
    "city": "Surat",
    "dob": "2002-05-15"
}

